{"id":"torrey:ascension-of-christ-the","source":"torrey","name":"Ascension Of Christ, The","slug":"ascension-of-christ-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Prophecies respecting — Ps 24:7; 68:18; Eph 4:7,8.","refs":[["Ps",24,7,24,7],["Ps",68,18,68,18],["Eph",4,7,4,7],["Eph",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"Foretold by himself — Joh 6:62; 7:33; 14:28; 16:5; 20:17.","refs":[["John",6,62,6,62],["John",7,33,7,33],["John",14,28,14,28],["John",16,5,16,5],["John",20,17,20,17]]},{"text":"Forty days after his resurrection — Ac 1:3.","refs":[["Acts",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"Described — Ac 1:9.","refs":[["Acts",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"From Mount Olivet — Lu 24:50; Mr 11:1; Ac 1:12.","refs":[["Luke",24,50,24,50],["Mark",11,1,11,1],["Acts",1,12,1,12]]},{"text":"While blessing his disciples — Lu 24:50.","refs":[["Luke",24,50,24,50]]},{"text":"When he had atoned for sin — Heb 9:12; 10:12.","refs":[["Heb",9,12,9,12],["Heb",10,12,10,12]]},{"text":"Was triumphant — Ps 68:18.","refs":[["Ps",68,18,68,18]]},{"text":"Was to supreme power and dignity — Lu 24:26; Eph 1:20,21; 1Pe 3:22.","refs":[["Luke",24,26,24,26],["Eph",1,20,1,20],["Eph",1,21,1,21],["1Pet",3,22,3,22]]},{"text":"As the forerunner of his people — Heb 6:20.","refs":[["Heb",6,20,6,20]]},{"text":"To intercede — Ro 8:34; Heb 9:24.","refs":[["Rom",8,34,8,34],["Heb",9,24,9,24]]},{"text":"To send the Holy Spirit — Joh 16:7; Ac 2:33.","refs":[["John",16,7,16,7],["Acts",2,33,2,33]]},{"text":"To receive gifts for men — Ps 68:18; Eph 4:8,11.","refs":[["Ps",68,18,68,18],["Eph",4,8,4,8],["Eph",4,11,4,11]]},{"text":"To prepare a place for his people — Joh 14:2.","refs":[["John",14,2,14,2]]},{"text":"His second coming shall be in like manner as — Ac 1:10,11.","refs":[["Acts",1,10,1,10],["Acts",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"Typified — Le 16:15; Heb 6:20; 9:7,9,12.","refs":[["Lev",16,15,16,15],["Heb",6,20,6,20],["Heb",9,7,9,7],["Heb",9,9,9,9],["Heb",9,12,9,12]]}],"refCount":38}
